# Witness for BulkMeetsCoreCreate. The edge's check is replaced by FALSE, so the
# invariant fails exactly when a kept step of its kind - a bulk birth - is
# reachable under every guarantee. A clean base run with this mutant red
# shows the edge was checked on real steps, not vacuously.
MODULE: BulkMeetsCoreCreateWitness
TARGET: BulkMeetsCoreCreate
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a bulk birth is reachable: the edge's check is not vacuous

--- FIND
Fails("BulkMeetsCoreCreate", CCreate)
--- REPLACE
Fails("BulkMeetsCoreCreate", FALSE)
--- END
